無疾，何所道。」遂朝服，步出東掖門，乃得車，仍還宅。是日遂以王儉爲侍中解璽。旣而武帝言於高帝，請誅朏。帝曰：「殺之則遂成其名，正應容之度外耳。」遂廢于家。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","source_position":{"first_line":15,"last_line":15,"revision_id":1506954,"editorial_excerpt_boundary":true},"mentions":[{"id":"c-liangshu-015-xiefei:p003:m0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"齊高帝","kind":"person","person_id":"47p_kjh_ez7","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依完整本傳敘事及身份閱讀記錄逐人辨識；原字不改，非由同字自動合併。","identity_decision_id":"d-liang015-xiefei-gaodi"},{"id":"c-liangshu-015-xiefei:p003:m0012","start":12,"end":13,"surface":"朏","kind":"person","person_id":"aa6_83c_juy_DBABAB","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依完整本傳敘事及身份閱讀記錄逐人辨識；原字不改，非由同字自動合併。","identity_decision_id":"d-liang015-xiefei-fei"},{"id":"c-liangshu-015-xiefei:p003:m0021","start":21,"end":23,"surface":"褚炫","kind":"person","person_id":"fxb_jh0_jba","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依完整本傳敘事及身份閱讀記錄逐人辨識；原字不改，非由同字自動合併。","identity_decision_id":"d-liang015-xiefei-chuxuan"},{"id":"c-liangshu-015-xiefei:p003:m0026","start":26,"end":28,"surface":"江斅","kind":"person","person_id":"s2k_e90_mxi","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依完整本傳敘事及身份閱讀記錄逐人辨識；原字不改，非由同字自動合併。","identity_decision_id":"d-liang015-xiefei-jiangxiao"},{"id":"c-liangshu-015-xiefei:p003:m0031","start":31,"end":33,"surface":"劉俁","kind":"person","person_id":"zqe_4qh_y1a","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依完整本傳敘事及身份閱讀記錄逐人辨識；原字不改，非由同字自動合併。","identity_decision_id":"d-liang015-xiefei-liuyu"},{"id":"c-liangshu-015-xiefei:p003:m0036","start":36,"end":38,"surface":"宋帝","kind":"person","person_id":"6y2_apj_l05","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依完整本傳敘事及身份閱讀記錄逐人辨識；原字不改，非由同字自動合併。","identity_decision_id":"d-liang015-xiefei-songdi"},{"id":"c-liangshu-015-xiefei:p003:m0042","start":42,"end":44,"surface":"天子","kind":"person","person_id":"6y2_apj_l05","status":"contextual_provisional",